  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance - IT/E-LEARNING, through Government of Romania</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Technical Assistance aids the Romanian Ministry of Education and Research (MOER) in the development of an Integrated Network for Education and Technologies (INET) project. The goal of INET is to upgrade existing networks and IT infrastructure at schools, universities and research centers to help develop students&apos; skills to satisfy the growing needs of employers as well as the nation&apos;s need for improved innovation. INET will re-equip existing education and research networks with modern functionalities to enable e-learning and sharing of know-how with knowledge-based enterprises. INET will provide greater exposure to students at research centers, universities and schools to prepare users with skills needed to compete in the knowledge economy.</narrative>
  </description>
